# Quantumult X 原生分流规则；默认策略：AppleTV
# 导入时可使用 force-policy 覆盖；保留源顺序，不做去重。
# AppleTV: 8
host-keyword,itunes.apple.com,AppleTV
host-suffix,tv.apple.com,AppleTV
host-suffix,tv.applemusic.com,AppleTV
host-suffix,aaplimg.com,AppleTV
host-suffix,apple-mapkit.com,AppleTV
host-suffix,hls.itunes.apple.com,AppleTV
host-suffix,hls-amt.itunes.apple.com,AppleTV
host-suffix,play-edge.apple.com,AppleTV
